meta {
  name: List backlog
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/issues?priority=HIGH
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  priority: HIGH
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  Backlog only - issues sitting on a sprint are excluded, as are subtasks, which belong to their
  parent rather than to the board.

  Filters combine with AND and are all optional: statusCategory, statusId, typeId, priority,
  reporterId, isBlocked, dueBefore, dueAfter, and q for a text match on title and description.
  Paging is page and pageSize; the totals come back in the "meta" block.

  assigneeId, unassigned and labelId are not wired yet - assignees and labels do not exist.
}
